 "reason": "Wall loss below the owner's minimum found by the last survey on the column bottoms line.",
 "scope": [
  "Isolate per the isolation list; drain, vent and purge 6\"-P300-P-1017 between the isolations; confirm gas-free for hot work.",
  "Remove spool 6\"-P300-P-1017-SP02 (8 items, 23'-5-1/2\" of pipe) — cut at the field welds and break the flanged joints at its ends as listed.",
  "Fabricate the replacement spool to ISO-6\"-P300-P-1017 with the same items (parts list), welding to WS-01; 7 shop welds.",
  "Install the spool; make 2 field welds; new gaskets and studs at flanged ends, tightened per SW-WO-5.",
  "NDE per the NDE table; hydrostatic test at 420 psi for 30 minutes with the relief valves blinded (SW-TEST-1).",
  "Remove blinds, restore the line-up, hand back."
 ],
